From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 06:10:15 +0000
Subject: fix(a11y): map hidden role on OHOS and iOS

The hidden role only hid subtrees on Android. OHOS now maps "hidden" to
ARKUI_ACCESSIBILITY_MODE_DISABLED_FOR_DESCENDANTS and iOS sets
accessibilityElementsHidden (and keeps the view out even when clickable).
Since upstream #1626, OHOS maps "none" to MODE_DISABLED, so Compose nodes
with no role and no text now send an empty role on OHOS, which resets them
to the renderer default instead of disabling them. Explicit NONE is unchanged.

Fork-Patch: a11y-hidden-role-ohos-ios
Origin: none (new for staging4, follows 191d1b93)
Upstream-Status: pending
Signed-off-by: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>

